  "elements": [
    {
      "id": "Al5sZqAcIhmAowz1ki0G9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 121,
      "y": 363.5,
      "width": 1079.5390625,
      "height": 1525,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1129882446,
      "version": 1711,
      "versionNonce": 199421724,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784801696838,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements\n-> User should be able to see Personal Job Application Board and search through it\n-> User should be able to update/change job labels on Job Board\n-> User should be able to sync job applications from gmail\n-> User should be able to validate emails labels with email descriptions and get company data using web search\n\nNon-Functional Requirements\n-> Write >> Read on job applications\n-> Sync process should be able to handle extraction and classification errors (fault tolerance)\n-> Retry mechanism for tool calls and agent incase of failures/timeouts (fault tolerance)\n-> Scope relevant job mails from 7000+ emails \n-> Improve Efficiency & Accuracy Of Models Used\n----------------------------------------------------------\nFuture/Later Scope:\n    -> Observability & Evals using golden dataset, llm-as-judge (Langfuse)\n    -> Guardrails to protect from prompt injections\n    -> LLMOps\n\n\n\nCore Entities\n-> Application\n-> StatusEvent\n\nSupporting Entities:\n-> ProcessedEmail\n-> CompanyProfile\n-> ReviewSuggestion\n\n\n\nAPIs\n\n// See + search the board\nGET /v1/applications?q={q}&status={status}&platform={platform} -> Application[]\n\nGET /v1/applications/{applicationId} -> Application   // includes its StatusEvent[]\n\n// Update a job label\nPOST /v1/applications/{applicationId}/status-events -> StatusEvent\nbody: {\n  \"status\": string\n}\n\n// Sync from Gmail\nPOST /v1/syncs -> Sync   // 202, runs in background\nbody: {\n  \"mode\": \"incremental\" | \"full_audit\"   // default \"incremental\"\n}\n\nGET /v1/syncs/{syncId} -> Sync   // poll progress/status\n\n\n// Validate label vs email + company data\nGET /v1/status-events/{eventId}/email -> Email\n\nPOST /v1/applications/{applicationId}/research -> CompanyProfile\nbody: {\n  \"refresh\": boolean   // default false, force a re-fetch\n}\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements\n-> User should be able to see Personal Job Application Board and search through it\n-> User should be able to update/change job labels on Job Board\n-> User should be able to sync job applications from gmail\n-> User should be able to validate emails labels with email descriptions and get company data using web search\n\nNon-Functional Requirements\n-> Write >> Read on job applications\n-> Sync process should be able to handle extraction and classification errors (fault tolerance)\n-> Retry mechanism for tool calls and agent incase of failures/timeouts (fault tolerance)\n-> Scope relevant job mails from 7000+ emails \n-> Improve Efficiency & Accuracy Of Models Used\n----------------------------------------------------------\nFuture/Later Scope:\n    -> Observability & Evals using golden dataset, llm-as-judge (Langfuse)\n    -> Guardrails to protect from prompt injections\n    -> LLMOps\n\n\n\nCore Entities\n-> Application\n-> StatusEvent\n\nSupporting Entities:\n-> ProcessedEmail\n-> CompanyProfile\n-> ReviewSuggestion\n\n\n\nAPIs\n\n// See + search the board\nGET /v1/applications?q={q}&status={status}&platform={platform} -> Application[]\n\nGET /v1/applications/{applicationId} -> Application   // includes its StatusEvent[]\n\n// Update a job label\nPOST /v1/applications/{applicationId}/status-events -> StatusEvent\nbody: {\n  \"status\": string\n}\n\n// Sync from Gmail\nPOST /v1/syncs -> Sync   // 202, runs in background\nbody: {\n  \"mode\": \"incremental\" | \"full_audit\"   // default \"incremental\"\n}\n\nGET /v1/syncs/{syncId} -> Sync   // poll progress/status\n\n\n// Validate label vs email + company data\nGET /v1/status-events/{eventId}/email -> Email\n\nPOST /v1/applications/{applicationId}/research -> CompanyProfile\nbody: {\n  \"refresh\": boolean   // default false, force a re-fetch\n}\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
